d":"08993633622891208299"}},"outputId":"ac7f8a05-359f-4b00-e054-53c84e0783e4"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1800x1000 with 8 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Interpretation: AE reconstructions correspond to the real images. VAE, DCGAN, and DDPM outputs do not correspond to those originals. The same seed across different architectures does not imply matching objects."],"metadata":{"id":"J5Hs_hw267zv"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Plot all training losses"],"metadata":{"id":"A-Hl_lc8699D"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(17, 9))\n","\n","\n","def plot_scalar_history(ax, saved, title, ylabel, key):\n","    history = saved[key]\n","    final_epoch = int(saved[\"epoch\"])\n","\n","    ax.set_title(title)\n","    ax.set_xlabel(\"Epoch\")\n","    ax.set_ylabel(ylabel)\n","    ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n","\n","    if not history:\n","        ax.text(\n","            0.5, 0.5,\n","            \"No saved loss history\",\n","            transform=ax.transAxes,\n","            ha=\"center\"\n","        )\n","        return\n","\n","    # Assumes consecutive losses ending at the saved epoch\n","    first_epoch = final_epoch - len(history) + 1\n","    epochs = range(first_epoch, final_epoch + 1)\n","\n","    ax.plot(epochs, history)\n","\n","    print(\n","        f\"{title}: {len(history)} losses, \"\n","        f\"epochs {first_epoch}–{final_epoch}\"\n","    )\n","\n","\n","saved = load_checkpoint(\"AE\")\n","plot_scalar_history(\n","    axes[0, 0], saved,\n","    \"AE\",\n","    \"Training reconstruction MSE\",\n","    \"history\"\n",")\n","del saved\n","\n","saved = load_checkpoint(\"VAE\")\n","plot_scalar_history(\n","    axes[0, 1], saved,\n","    \"VAE\",\n","    \"Reconstruction + KL loss\",\n","    \"history\"\n",")\n","del saved\n","\n","\n","# DCGAN has two loss histories\n","saved = load_checkpoint(\"DCGAN\")\n","history = saved[\"history\"]\n","ax = axes[0, 2]\n","\n","if history:\n","    first_epoch = saved[\"epoch\"] - len(history) + 1\n","    epochs = range(first_epoch, saved[\"epoch\"] + 1)\n","\n","    ax.plot(\n","        epochs,\n","        [record[\"generator\"] for record in history],\n","        label=\"Generator\"\n","    )\n","\n","    ax.plot(\n","        epochs,\n","        [record[\"discriminator\"] for record in history],\n","        label=\"Discriminator\"\n","    )\n","\n","    ax.legend()\n","\n","ax.set_title(\"DCGAN\")\n","ax.set_xlabel(\"Epoch\")\n","ax.set_ylabel(\"Adversarial loss\")\n","ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n","\n","del saved\n","\n","\n","for ax, name in zip(\n","    axes[1],\n","    [\n","        \"Cosine DDPM + attention\",\n","        \"Linear DDPM + attention\",\n","        \"Linear DDPM without attention\"\n","    ]\n","):\n","    saved = load_checkpoint(name)\n","\n","    plot_scalar_history(\n","        ax, saved,\n","        name,\n","        \"Noise-prediction MSE\",\n","        \"loss_history\"\n","    )\n","\n","    del saved\n","\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","plt.savefig(\n","    FIGURE_DIR / \"final_training_loss_comparison.png\",\n","    dpi=180,\n","    bbox_inches=\"tight\"\n",")\n","plt.show()"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":675},"id":"Dg-lj4MW6--j","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793015718526,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":3938,"user":{"displayName":"Prathik suresh","userId":"08993633622891208299"}},"outputId":"70881367-b3ff-44d6-80c1-743037ab5cb3"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["AE: 100 losses, epochs 1–100\n","VAE: 200 losses, epochs 1–200\n","Cosine DDPM + attention: 200 losses, epochs 1–200\n","Linear DDPM + attention: 200 losses, epochs 1–200\n","Linear DDPM without attention: 200 losses, epochs 1–200\n"]},{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1700x900 with 6 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Observations: Training Loss Comparison\n","\n","| Model | Observation |\n","|---|---|\n","| **Autoencoder (AE)** | Reconstruction MSE decreases from approximately 0.068 to 0.017 over the 100 epochs shown. Most improvement occurs early, followed by gradual stabilization. |\n","| **Variational Autoencoder (VAE)** | Combined reconstruction and KL loss decreases from approximately 330 to 178 over 200 epochs. Improvement slows after the early epochs. |\n","| **DCGAN** | Generator loss initially decreases, then rises to around 6.0. Discriminator loss decreases to around 0.15. This suggests that the discriminator increasingly distinguishes generated images from real images. The losses alone do not establish mode collapse or worsening image quality. |\n","| **Cosine DDPM + attention** | Noise-prediction MSE decreases from approximately 0.099 to 0.056, with small fluctuations after the initial decrease. |\n","| **Linear DDPM + attention** | Noise-prediction MSE decreases from approximately 0.064 to 0.030 and gradually stabilizes. |\n","| **Linear DDPM without attention** | Noise-prediction MSE decreases from approximately 0.064 to 0.031, following a similar trend to the attention-enabled linear model. |\n","\n","### Interpretation\n","\n","- AE, VAE, and DDPM losses fall sharply at the beginning and then decrease more slowly.\n","- GAN losses measure competing objectives, so they should not be interpreted like reconstruction or noise-prediction MSE.\n","- DCGAN FID improved from **44.66 at epoch 50 to 39.62 at epoch 200**, despite the rise in generator loss.\n","- The two linear DDPMs show similar training-loss trends, but their FID scores differ: **39.07 with attention** and **52.32 without attention**.\n","- Loss magnitudes across models—and across different noise schedules—should not be used alone to rank generated-image quality.\n","- Training curves alone cannot confirm or rule out overfitting."],"metadata":{"id":"EQeCGIVGm0lB"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from pathlib import Path\n","from PIL import Image\n","from IPython.display import display\n","\n","FIGURE_DIR = Path(\"/content/drive/MyDrive/DDPM/final_figures\")\n","\n","display(Image.open(\n","    FIGURE_DIR / \"final_qualitative_comparison.png\"\n","))\n","\n","display(Image.open(\n","    FIGURE_DIR / \"final_training_loss_comparison.png\"\n","))"],"metadata":{"id":"sZ4gGDj67RKj"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from google.colab import drive\n","drive.mount(\"/content/drive\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"WQ_ZXi8DDFd4","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793116167479,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":23661,"user":{"displayName":"Hamsavarthini Suresh Raja","userId":"07294834734740605173"}},"outputId":"403752ec-fe9e-4278-9c9d-1394dbfd9c7a"},"execution_count":1,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Mounted at /content/drive\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["!pip freeze > /content/drive/MyDrive/DDPM/requirements.txt\n","\n","print(\"Saved to Google Drive\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"5kBTcMGiDPHg","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1793116171331,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":2149,"user":{"displayName":"Hamsavarthini Suresh Raja","userId":"07294834734740605173"}},"outputId":"4468840c-ab04-4c0e-c327-cd9ff0e73440"},"execution_count":2,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Saved to Google Drive\n"]}]}]}